    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Complete Quest controller snapshot published on the <computeroutput>quest_controller</computeroutput> switchboard topic.</para>
<para>Both hand slots are always present. An absent controller has <computeroutput>available == false</computeroutput>, invalid poses, inactive controls, and neutral values. <computeroutput>xr_sample_time</computeroutput> is the OpenXR predicted display time used to locate the poses; <computeroutput>sample_time</computeroutput> is the corresponding <ref refid="namespaceILLIXR" kindref="compound">ILLIXR</ref> clock timestamp. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
